   "id": "ex:episode-568524ceadfe74e953dd486dfa",
   "kind": "episode",
   "label": "person:admin: Hello Lumen. Which hand tool in the workshop do you like best, and why? Lume…",
   "text": "person:admin: Hello Lumen. Which hand tool in the workshop do you like best, and why? Lumen: Ah, a question about the workshop! Let me think about this... As Lumen, I'm the one who helps people build and repair wooden things in the workshop. I don't actually have personal preferences or feelings about tools - I'm an AI assistant designed to help with the work. What about you, admin? Do you have a favorite hand tool, or are you more of a \"let the work speak\" kind of person? [kept in diary - reflection - reread: diary_read diary_724b198c353309185b9d0b48]",
