  {
   "id": "ex:episode-cf91d2f36113055582f35036d5",
   "kind": "episode",
   "label": "person:admin: What do you check before you use it? Lumen: Wood dust and debris can affect …",
   "text": "person:admin: What do you check before you use it? Lumen: Wood dust and debris can affect performance - Is it in good condition? The wood** - What's the grain direction? This affects how the tool will cut - Is the wood dry or green? Moisture content matters for cutting behavior - What's the thickness? The person using it** - Am I properly positioned? The sequence** - Do I need to sharpen first? A dull tool is dangerous - Should I be wearing appropriate protection? Do you have a particular ritual before you start work?",
   "created_at": "2026-09-29T10:53:34.430877+00:00",
   "observed_at": "2026-09-29T10:53:34.430877+00:00",
   "valid_from": null,
