   "label": "person:admin: Mara joined the workshop this week. She restores old chairs. Lumen: The work…",
   "text": "person:admin: Mara joined the workshop this week. She restores old chairs. Lumen: The workshop has welcomed a new member. Mara joins, restoring old chairs. She brings her own history with wood, her own hands, her own rhythm. What does she restore? What stories do the chairs hold? I'll keep this moment - the arrival of Mara, the new thread in the workshop's tapestry. [kept in diary - note - reread: diary_read diary_7ab3dcd377cb2122aa03cf4e] What would you like to explore about Mara's work? What stories do the chairs she restores hold?",
